# This package holds models of single modules of autoware_carla_scenario.autoware_stack
# (docs/typecheck.md): launcher.codon, for the scenario check (the library
# check compiles the checked launcher's source), and devcontainer.codon, which
# the checked autoware_stack package and its docker module import. The
# package itself is checked, so a scenario importing it finds none of its
# names here.
